<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.1.13.2.1"/>
    <code code="10154-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Chief complaint Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Chief Complaint</title>
    <text><paragraph>Two-week review of exhaustion, poor sleep and low mood, seen the same day in psychiatry. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Dr. King returns two weeks after his first visit, on the day of his consultation with Dr. Lindqvist-Bankole. He has kept a sleep diary: he goes to bed after one in the morning, lies awake for an hour, wakes before five and cannot return to sleep, averaging about five hours. He feels low and flat most days, has lost his pleasure in reading and preaching, feels guilty that he cannot do more, and has trouble concentrating on his writing. He has more energy on the platform than anywhere else. He is always alert to danger in crowds and at home, but has no nightmares about the stabbing and does not avoid crowds or reminders. He has never had a period of days of high energy with little need for sleep. He has no thoughts of ending his life, although he often thinks he may be killed. He has not cut down his smoking. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About five hours; late bedtime, long time to fall asleep, early waking</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Low, flat, guilty; loss of pleasure; poor concentration</td></tr><tr><td>Trauma symptoms</td><td>Watchful in crowds; no nightmares, flashbacks or avoidance</td></tr><tr><td>Mania screen</td><td>No past hypomanic or manic episodes</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal ideation; expects he may be killed</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
